error[TY005]: cannot add Str and Num
  --> python-methods.lm:12:7
   |
12 | print("a" + 1)
   |       ^^^^^^^ mismatched operands
   |
   = note: `+` joins two Nums, two Strs or two Lists
   = note: to build a string from mixed values use interpolation: "${a}${b}"
   = note: or turn the other value into text first: `str(n)`

error[TY005]: cannot apply `*` to Str and Num
  --> python-methods.lm:13:7
   |
13 | print("ab" * 3)
   |       ^^^^^^^^ mismatched operands
   |
   = note: `*` wants two Nums
   = note: `"ab".repeat(3)` repeats a string

error[TY012]: Option has no method `unwrap`
  --> python-methods.lm:14:7
   |
14 | print(Some(1).unwrap())
   |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ not available here
   |
   = note: an Option is taken apart with `match`, or `unwrapOr(fallback)`, or `?` to pass `None` up

